``` LF-02 | License Warnings and Violations: Which Day, Which Pool
    Interpretation and RCA: Splunk Administrator Field Manual (Gaurav Malik),
    entry LF-02. https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HRXCT384

    Run on: SH for the history, LM for the active messages.
    Query: Messages the LM is currently showing (LM)
    If this returns nothing, run probes/LF-02-probe.spl,
    probes/LF-02-probe-rest.spl to confirm the data it reads exists here.
```
| rest splunk_server=local /services/licenser/messages count=0
| eval created=strftime(create_time, "%F %T")
| table created category severity pool_id description
| sort - created
